 **Pitfalls:**
-- **Agent Radius vs Node Size:** Simple comparison of octree node size with AgentRadius is insufficient. Example: AgentRadius 700, octree alley sizes 200, 400, 200. It cannot pass through the 400-sized node despite the gap, requiring explicit collision testing [S1, unofficial].
-- **Collision Test Cache:** Running a collision test every time is expensive. Only run it when AgentRadius is larger than the node size, and cache the result for each node [S1, unofficial].
