 ## Background
-This method was developed for Unreal Engine 5 (UE5) as a simple SVO pathfinder for 3D pathfinding. It was presented in a tutorial video by an unofficial source. The method leverages the SVO structure for efficient spatial queries and combines A* with Lazy Theta* for optimal pathfinding [S1, unofficial].
